; Platinum System 12: the menu, title and button font of Platinum 2026.
;
; An original design. Its metrics follow the Mac OS 8 system font as
; measured in the HIG figures (docs/reference/platinum-fonts.md): cap
; height 9, x-height 7, 2 px vertical stems, 1 px horizontals, 2 px
; letter spacing, 4 px space. The letter shapes are drawn from scratch.
;
; Format: "char C ADVANCE TOP" (C is a character, U+XXXX or "space"),
; then one row per line from row TOP (relative to the baseline, 0 =
; baseline row) downwards; "#" is ink, "." is blank, and every row is
; ADVANCE wide. "mark NAME" defines an accent for composed letters.

font Platinum System
height 16
baseline 12
cap 9
xheight 7
accent-gap 1

char space 4 0

